Yes, you start accumulating protection again from scratch,
except that (HProtection & INTRINSIC) will still be set
so you don't get the 2-4 points for the first bump.  You can
still get 1 point though by donating to priests or sacrificing
(sometimes).

Here's a fun thing to try:  If you already have shock
resistance intrinsic and disintegration resistance
intrinsic, take off your suit, cloak and shirt
and pray on an altar over and over again.  The only thing
god can do to you is curse your inventory (which can be fixed
by dropping anything you don't want cursed before praying),
drop you an XP level, or send minions against you.  If
you're sufficiently beefy, elementals are no big deal, so
the only real effect if you're VERY CAREFUL is to lower your
XP.  Then, you can buy cheap protection if you can get to a
priest.  I take no responsibility for you getting killed
doing this, because you probably will if you push it too far,
but I've done it a few times just for kicks.  If you do this
in hell, you'll get demons instead of elementals.

Reading a few scrolls of create monster while confused helps.
It fills the room with acid blobs and it makes it harder for
the minions to get to you.

